## Performance Considerations

### Lazy Loading cho Heavy Widgets
```python
class HeavyWidget(QWidget):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self._content_loaded = False

    def showEvent(self, event):
        """Load content khi widget được hiển thị"""
        if not self._content_loaded:
            self.load_content()
            self._content_loaded = True
        super().showEvent(event)
```

### Memory Management
```python
class ImageWidget(QWidget):
    def __init__(self):
        super().__init__()
        self.cached_images = {}

    def clear_cache(self):
        """Xóa cache khi không cần thiết"""
        for image in self.cached_images.values():
            if hasattr(image, 'deleteLater'):
                image.deleteLater()
        self.cached_images.clear()
```
